postnews - post to topics

usage: postnews [group]

    New article. Subject and body. Ctrl-C aborts at any prompt.
    In the body you can move up with the arrows to fix earlier lines.
    Submit with a single line containing only "." .
    The default group is local. A missing group is created here.
    Only sysop / co-sysop may post.
    Read with readnews.
